errific VOs have been done by a streamer and voice actor Pablo Berrier AKA _Plabs for English, and a young aspiring actress Johanna Eisenhardt for GermanMany other improvements and fixesStea","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:45:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4307320-1841579228679513","game_id":"steam-4307320","kind":"announcement","title":"New Playtest version","summary":"New, hot hot!Hey there koala fans, animal lovers and enjoyers of hand-drawn games! We've been a bit silent lately, which only means we're working hard! Although we're working on many features and content that will come in the full game, we've also been working on updating the playtest, so the game can be checked out with even more features and content.So what's new in this version (a brief summary):Completely new level - tutorial level. Now you don't have to click on boring tutorial slides at th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T20:04:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228679513","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4307320-1836506165555126","game_id":"steam-4307320","kind":"announcement","title":"Open playtest is now live!","summary":"Open playtest is now... open!It will remain open for some time, probably until the demo is released and it reaches the gold version - so this is a limited time window for anyone to test the game and provide feedback and suggestions!We've already made adjustments to the game since it was last played at a live event, few weeks back. All criticism is welcome, especially constructive criticism :) Use the game Discord channel for leaving feedback: https://discord.com/invite/zqGZhwSnVMFirst streamers ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-26T20:11:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165555126","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4307320-1833968530887268","game_id":"steam-4307320","kind":"announcement","title":"Covert Koalas: Phasco at Expo Gamers 2026","summary":"Almost the end of the week and here's a bit of news as well! Expo GamersFirst off - GameGlis team will be attending Expo Gamers tomorrow & on Saturday (29th & 30th May 2026) and we'll have our own booth. Anyone who comes will be able to play the latest version of the game, so be sure to drop by if you're nearby :)Progress updateNext, we consider the first level of the game to be complete, and currently working on the rest. We highly appreciate all player feedback gathered at the last live event ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T06:47:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530887268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4307320-1830797770233184","game_id":"steam-4307320","kind":"announcement","title":"Covert Koalas: Phasco - game reveal & 1st live expo","summary":"Game revealKoala fans around the world - rejoice! The world will this year become richer by one more game focused on koalas - Covert Koalas: Phasco. Why koalas? Well, they are cute, fluffy, and not very bright. What else do you need? :) When did the devs of this fine game come about with this idea? At the beginning of 2025. We were looking to make a hand-drawn game which would feature an endangered species, and koalas happen to be on top of our cuteness list as well.When 